      "customfield_10012" : "0|i00593:",
      "customfield_10300" : "{}",
      "description" : {
         "content" : [
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : ">>> REVIEW Input??? Stream::Synchronized () method…",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "       EIKTHER DELETE OR DOCUMEN T BETTER/PUSH IN DOCS ABOUT SYNC ON STREAMS!!!",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : " ",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "              (probably bad design having METHOD to do that – but instead have class so wrapped at create time 0 – trouble with method is if you have two places using it and only oen does sync wrapper, or worse if two do but underlying unwrapped!",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : " ",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "       >>> YES – DEFINITELY REPLACE InputStream/OutputStream::Synrchonized () with SynchonizedStream (), that wraps underlying rep generically.",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "       >>>> MAYBE NO – MAYBE I HAD BEST ANYHOW – just document better?? Issue is – you have a bunch of diff types input, output, etc. By making it a METHOD, of each class (shadowed) – you get right return type automatically for Synchonized without lots of names and error prone mismatches.",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : " ",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "       Only thing I may want to add is “IsRepInternallySynchronized” so we avoid needless wrapping.",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : " ",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            }
         ],
